      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788966704117,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In-process execution Fast, but a\nbug can corrupt database memory\n/ bypass access control",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Vmes6CCtkljWTnCKO7giW",
      "originalText": "In-process execution Fast, but a\nbug can corrupt database memory\n/ bypass access control",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mviuXKkS7196_zE4VXzb3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 508.1401062011719,
      "y": 191,
      "width": 309.71978759765625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4c2a85",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 502566460,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 648014524,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788966704117,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "**Separate process +\ninterprocess communication**\nSafer, but much slower (tens of\nthousands of instructions of\noverhead)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "nMHNMGN69Tt-Wf1zXSij5",
      "originalText": "**Separate process +\ninterprocess communication**\nSafer, but much slower (tens of\nthousands of instructions of\noverhead)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1XVZmVmpknsLcAUJl5cCS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 916.4301147460938,
      "y": 191,
      "width": 332.1397705078125,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#14532d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1497327292,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 62271236,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788966704117,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sandbox execution\n(Java/C# only)\nRuns inside the query process but\nrestricted to its own memory —\nbest of both worlds",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "G9LRoxi7NP_UQiWbWo2Yd",
      "originalText": "Sandbox execution\n(Java/C# only)\nRuns inside the query process but\nrestricted to its own memory —\nbest of both worlds",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
